# 16. USE GEOHASH / SPATIAL PROXIMITY CACHE

GPS coordinates vary slightly.

Do not require exact coordinate equality for cache reuse.

Example:

```text
6.210151, 7.071221
```

and:

```text
6.210158, 7.071229
```

may represent effectively the same location.

Use:

```text
geohash
PostGIS spatial proximity
coordinate rounding
```

or an appropriate existing spatial method.

Reuse nearby address results when safely appropriate.

